            </p>

            <div class="mt-5">
                <a href="/books"
                   class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-[#17202a] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[#d8b77a] transition hover:bg-[#a47c43] hover:text-white">
                    Explore Books →
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>
<section class="w-full rounded-3xl border border-[#e4ddd0] bg-white p-5 shadow-lg md:p-8">

